OL,3,GNEWSAMan who transported Omagh bomb was
OL,4,Aan MI5 and Garda agent, inquiry told
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe detective who led the Omagh bombing
OL,7,Finvestigation has told an inquiry that
OL,8,Fhe believes the man who transported the
OL,9,Fbomb was an agent for both the UK
OL,10,Fsecurity services agency MI5 and the
OL,11,Fgardai (Irish police).
OL,13,FRetired Ch Supt Norman Baxter gave
OL,14,Fevidence to the Omagh Bombing Inquiry
OL,15,Fon Friday.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
