OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMan who transported Omagh bomb was
OL,4,Aan MI5 and Garda agent, inquiry told
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "As I went through the
OL,7,Finvestigation it became very apparent
OL,8,Fthat an individual was a Garda agent.
OL,9,FIt became apparent that in one
OL,10,Foperation there was a high potential
OL,11,Fthat he was jointly handled by the
OL,12,Fsecurity services."
OL,14,FBaxter said he also believed that
OL,15,Fintelligence services were aware of the
OL,16,Fbombers' activity before they carried
OL,17,Fout the Omagh bombing.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
